  "definition": "The IntraBalanceMovementInstruction message is sent from an account owner/requestor to a settlement infrastructure to instruct the movement of an amount of money within its holdings from one sub-balance to another.||Usage: |The message may be used to:|- re-send a message previously sent (the sub-function of the message is \"Duplicate\")|- provide a third party with a copy of a message for information (the sub-function of the message is \"Copy\")|- re-send to a third party a copy of a message for information (the sub-function of the message is \"CopyDuplicate\").",
